WEBVTT

00:08.896 --> 00:10.275
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.379 --> 00:12.068
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.172 --> 00:13.517
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.620 --> 00:15.344
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.448 --> 00:18.379
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:18.482 --> 00:20.586
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.689 --> 00:22.620
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:22.724 --> 00:24.655
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.758 --> 00:26.344
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.448 --> 00:28.655
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.758 --> 00:30.172
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.275 --> 00:32.655
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.758 --> 00:34.586
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.689 --> 00:36.586
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:36.689 --> 00:38.517
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.620 --> 00:40.482
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.586 --> 00:42.068
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.172 --> 00:44.034
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.137 --> 00:46.482
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.586 --> 00:48.793
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:48.896 --> 00:50.379
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:03.586 --> 01:06.551
- AH...PATRICK,
DON'T YOU LOVE STARING AT CLOUDS
- 啊...帕特里克，
你不喜欢凝视云吗

01:06.655 --> 01:08.310
AND THINKING ABOUT
WHAT THEY LOOK LIKE?
并思考
它们长什么样？

01:08.413 --> 01:13.413
- YEAH. IT REALLY CALMS
MY INNER DEMONS.
- 是的。真的很平静
我内心的恶魔。

01:13.517 --> 01:15.482
- WHOA!
LOOK AT THAT CLOUD!
- 哇！
看看那朵云！

01:15.586 --> 01:17.758
IT LOOKS JUST LIKE SANDY.
它看起来就像桑迪。

01:17.862 --> 01:20.034
- I'M NOT SEEING IT.
- 我没看到。

01:20.137 --> 01:21.793
OOH! BUT CHECK OUT THAT CLOUD!
哦！但看看那片云！

01:21.896 --> 01:23.689
I-IT LOOKS LIKE, UM...
我-它看起来像，嗯...

01:23.793 --> 01:25.448
U-UH...OH.
WAIT, WAIT, WAIT, WAIT.
呃……哦。
等等，等等，等等，等等。

01:25.551 --> 01:27.241
UH...D'OH, IT'S COMING!
呃...D'OH，它来了！

01:27.344 --> 01:30.172
UH, LOOKS LIKE...
UH...
呃，看起来像……
呃……

01:30.275 --> 01:31.206
A CLOUD!
一朵云！

01:31.310 --> 01:33.517
- MM. IT DOES!
- 毫米。确实如此！

01:33.620 --> 01:35.310
HEY, LOOK AT THAT ONE!
嘿，看看那个！

01:35.413 --> 01:37.793
[polka music]
[波尔卡音乐]

01:37.896 --> 01:40.137
IT LOOKS JUST LIKE
MR. KRABS, DOESN'T IT?
它看起来就像
先生。蟹蟹，不是吗？

01:40.241 --> 01:42.827
- SURE DOES. UH...
- 当然可以。呃……

01:42.931 --> 01:45.206
WHO'S MR. KRABS AGAIN?
谁是先生？又是螃蟹？

01:45.310 --> 01:49.275
WELL, NOW, THAT CLOUD
LOOKS LIKE A FLYING HOUSEBOAT.
好吧，现在，那朵云
看起来像一艘飞行船屋。

01:49.379 --> 01:52.172
[eerie moaning]
[诡异的呻吟声]

01:52.275 --> 01:53.655
- UM, PATRICK...
- 嗯，帕特里克...

01:53.758 --> 01:55.620
I THINK THAT REALLY IS
A FLYING HOUSEBOAT!
我认为确实如此
飞行船屋！

01:55.724 --> 01:58.620
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

01:58.724 --> 02:01.137
[engine sputtering]
[发动机溅射声]

02:01.241 --> 02:03.000
[steam hisses]
[蒸汽嘶嘶声]

02:13.103 --> 02:14.413
WHAT IS IT, PATRICK?
这是什么，帕特里克？

02:14.517 --> 02:15.827
- IT'S PROBABLY
JUST ONE OF THOSE
- 可能是
只是其中之一

02:15.931 --> 02:18.689
FAKE HAUNTED HOUSES,
YOU KNOW...FOR BABIES.
假鬼屋，
您知道...对于婴儿。

02:18.793 --> 02:22.482
- I DON'T KNOW, PATRICK.
IT'S VERY SCARY LOOKING.
- 我不知道，帕特里克。
看起来非常可怕。

02:22.586 --> 02:24.620
AND SPOOKY.
- THAT LOOKS LIKE FUN!
又诡异。
- 看起来很有趣！

02:24.724 --> 02:26.862
I'M GONNA CHECK IT OUT.
- PATRICK, WAIT FOR ME!
我要检查一下。
- 帕特里克，等我！

02:26.965 --> 02:29.689
[Patrick chortling]
[帕特里克咯咯笑]

02:29.793 --> 02:30.896
OOF!
钱币！

02:31.000 --> 02:33.413
[grunting and straining]
[咕哝和紧张]

02:33.517 --> 02:35.068
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

02:35.172 --> 02:36.862
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
CAN YOU GIVE ME A BOOST?
嘿，海绵宝宝，
你能给我鼓励吗？

02:36.965 --> 02:38.068
- UM--
- 嗯--

02:38.172 --> 02:40.413
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

02:40.517 --> 02:42.413
- LITTLE TO THE LEFT.
- 左边一点。

02:44.448 --> 02:46.586
LITTLE HELP.
没什么帮助。

02:46.689 --> 02:47.965
- OOF...
UGH!
- 噢...
呃！

02:48.068 --> 02:51.172
- HURRY UP, LAZYBONES.
- 快点，懒骨头。

02:51.275 --> 02:53.517
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:53.620 --> 02:55.620
- OHH...
- 哦...

02:55.724 --> 02:57.275
LOOK AT THIS PLACE!
看看这个地方！

02:57.379 --> 02:59.000
IT'S SO CHEESY.
太俗气了。

02:59.103 --> 03:02.448
CHECK OUT THIS LAME DOORKNOB.
看看这个蹩脚的门把手。

03:02.551 --> 03:03.931
- [shrieks]
- [尖叫]

03:04.034 --> 03:05.517
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

03:05.620 --> 03:07.206
- LET'S CHECK OUT INSIDE.
- 让我们看看里面。

03:07.310 --> 03:08.448
- I DON'T KNOW, PATRICK.
- 我不知道，帕特里克。

03:08.551 --> 03:11.896
- OH, COME ON.
DON'T BE SUCH A BABY.
- 哦，来吧。
别像个孩子一样。

03:13.413 --> 03:16.068
- WOW.
SO LAME.
- 哇。
太蹩脚了。

03:20.275 --> 03:22.689
NICE ATTENTION
TO DETAIL, THOUGH.
很好的关注
不过，要详细说明。

03:27.482 --> 03:30.344
HA! SO NOT SCARY.
哈！所以不可怕。

03:30.448 --> 03:31.758
- HEY!
- 嘿！

03:31.862 --> 03:34.965
THIS IS A NICE PICTURE.
这是一张漂亮的照片。

03:35.068 --> 03:36.827
AAH!
AAH!
啊啊！
啊啊！

03:36.931 --> 03:40.758
[screaming]
[尖叫]

03:40.862 --> 03:42.206
- DID YOU SAY SOMETHING,
SPONGEBOB?
- 你有说什么吗？
海绵宝宝？

03:42.310 --> 03:46.103
- AAH! AAH! AAH!
AAH!
- 啊啊！啊啊！啊啊！
啊啊！

03:48.965 --> 03:50.137
YIII!
- HEY, SPONGEBOB,
呀！
- 嘿，海绵宝宝，

03:50.241 --> 03:52.689
CHECK THIS OUT.
- OKAY, I'LL BE RIGHT THERE.
检查一下。
- 好的，我马上就到。

03:52.793 --> 03:55.758
- EVEN THE SPIDERS ARE FAKE.
- 连蜘蛛都是假的。

03:55.862 --> 03:57.344
I WISH SOMETHING WOULD...
我希望有一些东西...

03:57.448 --> 03:59.758
POP OUT OF A CLOSET.
从壁橱里跳出来。

03:59.862 --> 04:02.206
LIKE A BIG, HAIRY HAND.
就像一只毛茸茸的大手。

04:02.310 --> 04:04.034
THAT WOULD BE SCARY.
那会很可怕。

04:04.137 --> 04:06.103
- AAH!
- AH, BUT THIS PLACE
- 啊啊！
- 啊，但是这个地方

04:06.206 --> 04:08.275
IS TOO LOW-BUDGET FOR THAT.
- AAH!
预算太低了。
- 啊啊！

04:10.413 --> 04:12.137
- WOULD BE COOL, THOUGH,
WOULDN'T IT?
- 不过会很酷，
不是吗？

04:12.241 --> 04:14.344
- YEAH. THAT'D BE...
[gulp]
- 是的。那是……
[吞咽]

04:14.448 --> 04:16.931
NEATO.
[organ music]
内托。
[管风琴音乐]

04:17.034 --> 04:19.241
PATRICK, WHERE IS THAT
MUSIC COMING FROM?
帕特里克，那是哪里
音乐来自哪里？

04:19.344 --> 04:21.758
- I THINK IT'S COMIN'
FROM THAT GUY.
- 我想它即将到来
来自那个家伙。

04:21.862 --> 04:27.379
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

04:27.482 --> 04:35.137
- WHO DARES TRESPASS UPON
ME HAUNTED HOUSEBOAT?
- 谁敢侵犯
我的船屋闹鬼？

04:35.241 --> 04:36.517
- WE DO!
- 我们愿意！

04:36.620 --> 04:41.172
- AYE. AND WHAT MANNER
OF BEASTIE MIGHT YOU TWO BE?
- 是的。以及以什么方式
你们两个可能是野兽吗？

04:41.275 --> 04:44.517
- LOOK AT THE ATTENTION
TO DETAIL IN HIS MOUTH!
- 看注意
细节在他嘴里！

04:44.620 --> 04:47.793
IT'S ALL...
ROTTEN AND SLIMY!
这就是全部...
又烂又粘！

04:47.896 --> 04:50.758
- HAAAAH!
- 哈啊！

04:50.862 --> 04:54.310
- HIS BAD BREATH...
[choking] IS INCREDIBLE.
- 他的口臭......
[窒息] 难以置信。

04:54.413 --> 04:56.517
BOY, HIS HAIR'S
VERY AUTHENTIC TOO.
男孩，他的头发
也非常正宗。

04:56.620 --> 04:58.000
IT'S DIRTY...
[sniffs]
它很脏...
[嗅嗅]

04:58.103 --> 04:59.689
WHOO! IT REEKS.
哇！味道很臭。

04:59.793 --> 05:02.137
AND CHECK OUT THE WORKMANSHIP
ON THE JAW MECHANISM!
并检查做工
在下巴机构上！

05:02.241 --> 05:04.689
REMARKABLE BUILD QUALITY.
卓越的建造质量。

05:04.793 --> 05:07.103
- [grunts]
- OBVIOUSLY A PUPPET.
- [咕哝]
- 显然是一个木偶。

05:07.206 --> 05:08.896
OR A ROBOT.
OH!
或者机器人。
哦！

05:09.000 --> 05:11.758
WE MUST BE AT ONE OF THOSE
FANCY PIZZA PARLORS
我们必须是其中之一
精美披萨店

05:11.862 --> 05:14.206
WITH THOSE SINGIN'
ANIMATED ROBOTS!
与那些歌唱的人
动画机器人！

05:14.310 --> 05:16.103
- ROBOTS?
PUPPETS?
- 机器人？
木偶？

05:16.206 --> 05:18.137
PIZZA PARLORS?
披萨店？

05:18.241 --> 05:20.482
AAAARRRR!
啊啊啊！

05:20.586 --> 05:22.344
- SING US A SONG, ROBOT.
- 给我们唱首歌吧，机器人。

05:22.448 --> 05:24.724
- WHAT? SING FOR YE?
- 什么？为你歌唱？

05:24.827 --> 05:26.896
- OH, OOPS. HA HA.
YOU'RE RIGHT.
- 哦，哎呀。哈哈。
你说得对。

05:27.000 --> 05:28.172
I ALMOST FORGOT.
我差点忘了。

05:28.275 --> 05:29.482
[ting]
[叮]

05:29.586 --> 05:32.034
YOU'RE COIN-OPERATED,
AREN'T YOU?
您是投币式的，
你不是吗？

05:32.137 --> 05:33.034
[clink]
[碰杯]

05:33.137 --> 05:36.137
- AARR--AARR--
[coughs] YAAH...
-AARR--AARR--
[咳嗽] 啊啊……

05:36.241 --> 05:38.620
YAAH!
HMM.
啊啊！
唔。

05:38.724 --> 05:41.275
SO YOU WANT ME TO SING YA
A SHANTY, HEY?
所以你想让我唱歌
棚屋，嘿？

05:41.379 --> 05:43.931
- UH-HUH, UH-HUH!
- DON'T PUT YOURSELF OUT FOR US.
- 嗯嗯，嗯嗯！
- 不要为我们出卖自己。

05:44.034 --> 05:47.068
- AND YOU DO NOT THINK
I'M A REAL GHOST, DO YE?
- 而你不认为
我是一个真正的幽灵，你也是吗？

05:47.172 --> 05:48.724
- NOPE.
- I DO, MR. DEAD PIRATE, SIR!
- 没有。
- 我愿意，先生。死海盗了，先生！

05:48.827 --> 05:51.137
- OH, HA HA, I'LL SING YE
A SONG, ALL RIGHT...
- 哦，哈哈，我来唱歌
一首歌，好吧……

05:51.241 --> 05:53.413
A SONG SO TERRIFYING,
一首如此恐怖的歌曲，

05:53.517 --> 05:56.655
YOU'LL HAVE TO BELIEVE
I'M A GHOST!
你必须相信
我是幽灵！

05:56.758 --> 06:02.000
HA HA HA HA HA HA HA!
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！

06:03.379 --> 06:06.137
- THIS SHOW'S GONNA BE
SO AWESOME.
- 这个节目将会是
太棒了。

06:06.241 --> 06:09.206
- YEAH, AWESOME.
- 是啊，太棒了。

06:09.310 --> 06:10.724
- HIT IT, FINGERS!
- 击中它，手指！

06:12.310 --> 06:13.413
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪
♪♪

06:13.517 --> 06:14.344
- ♪ YO
- ♪ HO
- ♪ 哟
- ♪ 何

06:14.448 --> 06:15.344
- ♪ HO
- ♪ 何

06:15.448 --> 06:17.896
- ♪ YO HO-OH
- ♪ 哟霍哦

06:18.000 --> 06:19.896
- THEY'RE GOOD!
- 他们很好！

06:20.000 --> 06:22.103
- ♪ OH, WE'RE THE GHOULS
OF THE BRINY DEEP ♪
- ♪ 哦，我们是食尸鬼
深海的咸水♪

06:22.206 --> 06:24.448
♪ UNDER THE WAVES
WE LIKE TO CREEP ♪
♪ 海浪之下
我们喜欢爬行 ♪

06:24.551 --> 06:26.448
- ♪ SLEEPING IN COFFINS
WITH SPIDER WEBS ♪
- ♪ 睡在棺材里
有蜘蛛网 ♪

06:26.551 --> 06:28.862
♪ AS GHOSTLY PILLOWS
BENEATH OUR HEADS ♪
♪ 如同幽灵般的枕头
在我们的头下♪

06:28.965 --> 06:31.000
- ♪ OH, WE'RE THE GHOULS
OF THE BRINY DEEP ♪
- ♪ 哦，我们是食尸鬼
深海的咸水♪

06:31.103 --> 06:33.344
- ♪ UNDER THE WAVES
WE LIKE TO CREEP ♪
- ♪ 海浪之下
我们喜欢爬行 ♪

06:33.448 --> 06:35.241
♪ WE WEAR BLACK SHROUDS
THAT LOOK QUITE NEAT ♪
♪ 我们穿着黑色裹尸布
看起来很整洁 ♪

06:35.344 --> 06:37.241
♪ BUT WE DON'T OWN SHOES
♪ 但我们没有鞋子

06:37.344 --> 06:38.551
♪ 'CAUSE WE HAVE NO FEET
♪ 因为我们没有脚

06:38.655 --> 06:39.724
♪ HA HA HA
♪ 哈哈哈

06:39.827 --> 06:47.137
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

06:47.241 --> 06:49.482
- ♪ WE LIKE TO HAUNT
AND FRIGHTEN AND SCARE ♪
- ♪ 我们喜欢闹鬼
又惊又怕 ♪

06:49.586 --> 06:51.689
♪ TILL YOU JUMP RIGHT OUT
OF YOUR UNDERWEAR ♪
♪ 直到你跳出来
你的内衣 ♪

06:51.793 --> 06:53.896
♪ WE LIKE TO EAT
EYES AND BRAINS ♪
♪ 我们喜欢吃
眼睛和大脑♪

06:54.000 --> 06:56.103
♪ AND DRINK OUR GROG
FROM RUSTY DRAINS ♪
♪ 喝我们的烈酒
来自生锈的下水道♪

06:56.206 --> 06:59.724
♪ WE DON'T KEEP ANIMALS
LIKE CUTESY SNAILS ♪
♪ 我们不饲养动物
像可爱的蜗牛一样♪

06:59.827 --> 07:01.206
- GARY!
- 加里！

07:01.310 --> 07:04.827
- ♪ OUR FAVORITE PET'S
THE CAT-O'-NINE-TAILS ♪
- ♪ 我们最喜欢的宠物
九尾猫♪

07:04.931 --> 07:06.068
- MEOW.
- 喵。

07:07.448 --> 07:08.827
- AAH!
- DO YOU BELIEVE
- 啊啊！
- 你相信吗

07:08.931 --> 07:11.862
WE'RE REAL GHOSTS NOW?
我们现在是真正的幽灵了吗？

07:11.965 --> 07:13.241
- WHERE'S MY PIZZA?
- 我的披萨在哪里？

07:13.344 --> 07:16.482
WHAT KINDA PIZZA JOINT
ARE YOU RUNNING ANYHOW?
什么样的披萨店
你还在跑步吗？

07:16.586 --> 07:20.000
- PIZZA?
I'LL GIVE YA PIZZA.
- 比萨？
我给你吃披萨。

07:21.931 --> 07:24.655
- THAT'S MORE LIKE IT!
- 更像是这样！

07:24.758 --> 07:25.965
- MEEP. MEEP.
- MEEP, MEEP.
- 米普。米普。
- 米普，米普。

07:26.068 --> 07:28.931
- MEEP, MEEP, MEEP, MEEP.
- MEEP-MEEP-MEEP!
- 米普，米普，米普，米普。
- 喵喵喵！

07:29.034 --> 07:31.586
- ANCHOVIES?
- ANCHOVIES?
- 凤尾鱼？
- 凤尾鱼？

07:33.793 --> 07:35.379
- YOU ARE REAL GHOSTS!
- YOU ARE REAL GHOSTS!
- 你们是真正的幽灵！
- 你们是真正的幽灵！

07:35.482 --> 07:37.241
- YOU ARE REAL GHOSTS!
- YOU ARE REAL GHOSTS!
- 你们是真正的幽灵！
- 你们是真正的幽灵！

07:37.344 --> 07:40.172
- AH...HA HA HA!
- 啊……哈哈哈！

07:40.275 --> 07:43.241
SO YE FINALLY BELIEVE, EH?
所以你终于相信了，嗯？

07:43.344 --> 07:45.724
YOU SCURVY SWABS.
你这坏血病。

07:45.827 --> 07:47.620
- WE DO, WE DO!
- PLEASE, DON'T KILL ME
- 我们愿意，我们愿意！
- 求求你，别杀我

07:47.724 --> 07:51.862
WITH YOUR DEATH RAY EYES,
MR. GHOST ROBOT!
用你的死亡射线眼睛，
先生。幽灵机器人！

07:51.965 --> 07:53.724
TAKE MY BEST FRIEND INSTEAD!
以我最好的朋友代替！

07:53.827 --> 07:55.482
HE'S LIVED A FULL LIFE!
他过着充实的生活！

07:55.586 --> 07:57.896
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

07:58.000 --> 07:59.413
- YEAH, GREAT FRIEND
YOU HAVE HERE.
- 是的，好朋友
你在这里。

07:59.517 --> 08:01.137
- WHY HAVE YOU COME
TO BIKINI BOTTOM,
- 你为什么来
到比基尼下装，

08:01.241 --> 08:03.310
OH MIGHTY DEAD PIRATE-TYPE
PERSON, SIR?
OH MIGHTY DEAD 海盗型
先生，是个人吗？

08:03.413 --> 08:04.862
- IT'S FUNNY YOU SHOULD ASK.
- 你应该问这个问题，这很有趣。

08:04.965 --> 08:06.862
USUALLY WHEN I COME TO TOWN,
IT'S TO...
通常当我来到城里时，
这是为了...

08:06.965 --> 08:08.344
TERRIFY THE POPULACE!
恐吓民众！

08:08.448 --> 08:11.586
AND ENSLAVE THEIR SOULS
IN ETERNAL TORMENT!
并奴役他们的灵魂
在永恒的折磨中！

08:11.689 --> 08:14.965
HAH HAH HAH HAH HAH!
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！

08:15.068 --> 08:17.620
AH, BUT THIS TIME,
WE JUST BLEW A HEAD GASKET.
啊，但这一次，
我们刚刚爆了一个头部垫圈。

08:17.724 --> 08:20.758
- OH. I DIDN'T KNOW YOU GHOSTS
HAD GASKETS IN YOUR HEADS.
- 哦。我不认识你们这些鬼魂
你的头上有垫圈。

08:20.862 --> 08:22.793
- NOT US, YOU IMBECILE!
- 不是我们，你这个白痴！

08:22.896 --> 08:25.793
OUR ENGINE ROOM BROKE DOWN.
我们的机舱坏了。

08:25.896 --> 08:28.896
[coughing]
[咳嗽]

08:29.000 --> 08:33.068
HEY, CHARLIE, YOU GOT
THAT BUSTED HEAD GASKET OUT YET?
嘿，查理，你有
那个损坏的头部垫圈还没有出来吗？

08:33.172 --> 08:35.275
- HERE YOU GO, BOSS.
- 给你，老板。

08:37.206 --> 08:39.862
LOOKS LIKE WE NEED A NEW ONE.
看起来我们需要一个新的。

08:39.965 --> 08:41.482
- SAY...
- 说...

08:41.586 --> 08:43.517
MAYBE YOU TWO MORONS--
EH--[ahem]--
也许你们两个白痴——
诶——[咳咳]——

08:43.620 --> 08:47.862
ER, FINE GENTLEMEN
COULD PICK UP A NEW ONE FOR US.
呃，好先生们
可以为我们挑选一件新的。

08:47.965 --> 08:49.413
- [gulp]
U-US?
- [吞咽]
美国？

08:49.517 --> 08:50.965
- YES, YOU!
- 是的，就是你！

08:51.068 --> 08:54.275
AND JUST AS A LITTLE INCENTIVE
TO MAKE YOU RETURN...
只是作为一点激励
为了让你回来...

08:57.344 --> 09:01.689
I'LL TAKE YOUR SOULS
AS DEPOSIT!
我会带走你的灵魂
作为押金！

09:19.137 --> 09:22.413
HERE'S A SHINY DOUBLOON
TO BUY A NEW GASKET.
这是闪亮的达布隆币
购买新垫圈。

09:22.517 --> 09:26.275
SUCCEED, AND MAYBE YOU'LL GET
ANOTHER DOUBLOON.
成功，也许你会得到
另一个达布隆。

09:26.379 --> 09:28.344
IF YOU AREN'T BACK
IN 24 HOURS,
如果你还没回来
24 小时内，

09:28.448 --> 09:29.586
YOUR SOULS ARE MINE,
你的灵魂是我的，

09:29.689 --> 09:32.827
AND YOU'LL BE PART OF ME
GHASTLY CREW!
你将成为我的一部分
可怕的船员！

09:32.931 --> 09:34.896
UH...
呃……

09:35.000 --> 09:36.482
HERE. LET'S SEE HERE.
这里。让我们看看这里。

09:36.586 --> 09:38.448
THREE WEEKS FROM THURSDAY...
从星期四开始三周...

09:38.551 --> 09:41.758
FOREVERRRRR!
永远RRRR！

09:41.862 --> 09:43.206
- UM...CAN WE RUN
SCREAMING IN HORROR
- 嗯...我们可以跑吗
恐怖尖叫

09:43.310 --> 09:45.206
FROM YOUR SHIP NOW,
MR. GHOST PIRATE, SIR?
现在从你的船上，
先生。幽灵海盗，先生？

09:45.310 --> 09:47.344
- OH, WHY, CERTAINLY.
- 哦，为什么，当然。

09:47.448 --> 09:48.965
- PATRICK, AFTER YOU.
- 帕特里克，在你之后。

09:49.068 --> 09:51.275
- AAH!
- AAH!
- 啊啊！
- 啊啊！

09:51.379 --> 09:53.931
- SUCH A POLITE LAD.
- 多么有礼貌的小伙子。

09:54.034 --> 10:00.310
- AAH!
- AAH!
- 啊啊！
- 啊啊！

10:00.413 --> 10:02.413
- ONE SCOOP, PLEASE.
- 请一勺。

10:02.517 --> 10:06.862
- MMM!
- MMM...MMM...MMM.
- 嗯！
- 嗯……嗯……嗯。

10:06.965 --> 10:10.862
- AAH!
- AAH!
- 啊啊！
- 啊啊！

10:15.034 --> 10:18.551
- GHOST! GHOST!
HAUNTED HOUSEBOAT!
- 鬼！鬼！
闹鬼的船屋！

10:18.655 --> 10:20.551
- [mumbling]
HOUTHBOAT PHULL OF GHOTHS!
- [咕哝]
HOUTHBOAT 幽灵之魂！

10:20.655 --> 10:23.275
[both whimpering,
wailing]
[两人都呜咽着，
哀号]

10:23.379 --> 10:26.068
- WHHHAAAA!
- [gibbering]
- 哇哈哈！
- [胡言乱语]

10:26.172 --> 10:28.896
- EEW! EEW!
EEW! EEW!
- 呃！呃！
呃！呃！

10:30.793 --> 10:32.793
- HEY! THOSE GUYS ARE INSANE.
- 嘿！那些家伙疯了。

10:32.896 --> 10:35.689
- GET OUTTA HERE!
- SCRAM!
- 离开这里！
- 尖叫！

10:35.793 --> 10:37.965
- WHAT'S ALL THE COMMOTION
OUT HERE?
- 到底发生了什么？
在这里？

10:38.068 --> 10:41.793
- AAH!
[sobs] COME BA-AA-ACK!
- 啊啊！
[抽泣]来吧，BA-AA-ACK！

10:41.896 --> 10:45.448
SPONGEBOB, WHAT IN THE BULGING
BLUE BARNACLES ARE YOU UP TO?
海绵宝宝，凸出的是什么
蓝色藤壶你准备好了吗？

10:45.551 --> 10:47.241
- MR. KRABS, IT WAS AWFUL!
- 先生。蟹蟹，太糟糕了！

10:47.344 --> 10:50.034
WE JUST HAD A SPOOKY
ENCOUNTER OF THE GHOSTLY KIND!
我们刚刚经历了一场怪异
幽灵般的遭遇！

10:50.137 --> 10:51.724
- YOU HAD A WHAT?
- 你有什么？

10:51.827 --> 10:53.586
- WE WERE JUST MINDING
OUR OWN BUSINESS,
- 我们只是介意
我们自己的生意，

10:53.689 --> 10:55.724
AND THEN A HAUNTED HOUSEBOAT
FELL OUT OF THE SKY.
然后是闹鬼的船屋
从天上掉下来。

10:55.827 --> 10:57.448
- AND IT WATH FULL OF
GHOTHS--
- 它充满了
戈特斯——

10:57.551 --> 11:00.793
THE REALLY REAL KIND,
NOT FAKE KIND.
真正的真实的种类，
不是假货。

11:03.413 --> 11:05.206
- THE CAPTAIN OF THE GHOSTS
GAVE US THIS DOUBLOON
- 幽灵队长
给了我们这个达布隆

11:05.310 --> 11:07.413
AND TOLD US TO BUY HIM
A NEW HEAD GASKET.
并告诉我们买下他
新的头垫片。

11:07.517 --> 11:09.448
AND THEN HE TOOK OUR SOULS
AND HE PUT THEM IN BOTTLES,
然后他夺走了我们的灵魂
他把它们放进瓶子里，

11:09.551 --> 11:10.793
AND HE SAID HE'S GONNA
TURN US INTO GHOSTS
他说他会
把我们变成幽灵

11:10.896 --> 11:12.137
IF WE DON'T GET
THAT HEAD GASKET!
如果我们没有得到
那个头垫片！

11:12.241 --> 11:13.793
YOU GOTTA HELP US,
MR. KRABS!
你必须帮助我们，
先生。螃蟹！

11:13.896 --> 11:16.206
I FEEL SO EMPTY
WITHOUT MY SOUL!
我感觉很空虚
没有我的灵魂！

11:16.310 --> 11:17.896
- DID YOU SAY...
- 你说...

11:18.000 --> 11:19.689
DOUBLOON?
达布隆？

11:19.793 --> 11:21.206
LET ME SEE THAT.
让我看看。

11:21.310 --> 11:24.103
HMM. LOOKS SOMEWHAT
AUTHENTIC.
唔。看起来有点像
正品。

11:26.655 --> 11:28.379
SMELLS REAL ENOUGH.
闻起来很真实。

11:40.413 --> 11:41.586
- HEY!
- 嘿！

11:41.689 --> 11:45.241
- OKAY. LET'S GO SEE
THOSE GHOSTS, FELLERS.
- 好的。我们去看看
那些鬼魂，家伙们。

11:45.344 --> 11:47.931
WE'LL CATCH 'EM
AND TAKE THEIR GOLD!
我们会抓住他们
夺走他们的黄金！

11:48.034 --> 11:49.344
- BUT, MR. KRABS,
-但是，先生。螃蟹，

11:49.448 --> 11:51.724
WE DON'T KNOW THE FIRST THING
ABOUT GHOST HUNTING.
我们不知道第一件事
关于幽灵狩猎。

11:51.827 --> 11:53.689
[static feedback]
[both whimpering]
【静态反馈】
[两人都呜咽]

11:53.793 --> 11:55.517
- I'LL CATCH YOUR GHOSTS
FOR YA.
- 我会抓住你的鬼魂
为了你。

11:55.620 --> 11:58.103
IT'LL BE EASY
WITH MY NEWFANGLED PARANORMAL
这会很容易
与我的新奇超自然现象

11:58.206 --> 11:59.482
CRITTER DETECTOR CATCHER
GIZMO.
小动物探测器捕捉器
发明家。

11:59.586 --> 12:01.758
- AND...YOU JUST HAPPENED
TO BRING THAT WITH YOU
- 而且...你刚刚发生了
随身携带

12:01.862 --> 12:03.275
TO THE KRUSTY KRAB.
到了脆皮蟹。

12:03.379 --> 12:05.862
- SURE. I WAS LOOKING FOR
MILKSHAKE GREMLINS.
- 当然。我一直在寻找
奶昔小精灵。

12:07.206 --> 12:08.275
[feedback squeal]
[反馈尖叫声]

12:08.379 --> 12:09.827
NOPE. NONE IN THERE.
没有。那里没有。

12:09.931 --> 12:11.689
- GREAT!
THEN IT'S SETTLED.
- 伟大的！
然后事情就解决了。

12:11.793 --> 12:14.068
LET'S GO CATCH US
SOME GHOST GOLD!
我们去追我们吧
一些幽灵金！

12:14.172 --> 12:16.482
- WHAT MAKES YOU THINK
I HAVE ANY INTEREST
- 是什么让你这么想
我有兴趣

12:16.586 --> 12:19.482
IN YOUR DELUSIONAL
ADVENTURISM?
在你的妄想中
冒险主义？

12:19.586 --> 12:21.275
- COME ON, SQUIDWARD.
- 来吧，章鱼哥。

12:21.379 --> 12:23.137
THINK ABOUT
WHAT ALL THOSE DOUBLOONS
想想
那些双币是什么？

12:23.241 --> 12:25.517
COULD DO FOR
THE KRUSTY KRAB, EY? HUH?
可以做的
甲壳蟹，EY？嗯？

12:25.620 --> 12:27.724
WHY, I COULD BUY YOU
THAT BREAK ROOM
为什么，我可以买下你
那个休息室

12:27.827 --> 12:30.000
YOU'RE ALWAYS WHINING ABOUT.
你总是在抱怨。

12:32.448 --> 12:33.896
[beep]
[嘟]

12:34.000 --> 12:34.931
- OKAY. I'M IN.
- 好的。我来了。

12:35.034 --> 12:38.068
- SUPER!
MORE HANDS MEANS MORE GOLD.
- 极好的！
更多的手意味着更多的黄金。

12:38.172 --> 12:39.551
SO WHAT DO YOU SAY,
SPONGEBOB?
那么你说什么，
海绵宝宝？

12:39.655 --> 12:41.758
ARE YOU READY?
你准备好了吗？

12:41.862 --> 12:44.000
- I'LL GO.
BUT JUST TO GET MY SOUL BACK.
- 我去。
但只是为了找回我的灵魂。

12:44.103 --> 12:46.379
- WHO NEEDS A SOUL
WHEN YOU'RE FILTHY RICH?
- 谁需要灵魂
当你变得非常富有时？

12:49.551 --> 12:53.413
[ominous organ chords]
- SO...HERE IT IS.
[不祥的风琴和弦]
- 所以...就在这里。

12:53.517 --> 12:54.862
PRETTY CREEPY, HUH?
相当令人毛骨悚然，是吧？

12:54.965 --> 12:57.862
- THIS PLACE LOOKS LIKE IT
HASN'T BEEN LIVED IN FOR YEARS.
- 这个地方看起来像这样
已经多年无人居住。

12:57.965 --> 13:01.137
- FOUR YEARS?
GOTTA BE LONGER THAN THAT.
- 四年？
一定比那更长。

13:01.241 --> 13:03.137
- I DON'T SEE
ANY SIGNS OF GHOSTS.
- 我没看到
任何鬼魂迹象。

13:03.241 --> 13:05.758
NOTHING HERE BUT A BUNCH
OF TACKY OLD FURNITURE
这里什么也没有，只有一堆
俗气的旧家具

13:05.862 --> 13:08.172
AND BORING
REPRESENTATIONAL ART.
和无聊
代表性艺术。

13:08.275 --> 13:09.965
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

13:10.068 --> 13:11.000
- HUH?
- 嗯？

13:11.103 --> 13:13.379
- LOOK, MR. KRABS.
THE DOUBLOONS!
- 看，先生。螃蟹。
双布隆！

13:13.482 --> 13:15.034
- [squeals]
- [尖叫声]

13:15.137 --> 13:16.586
HA HA HA!
哈哈哈！

13:16.689 --> 13:19.793
[making slobbering noises]
[发出流口水的声音]

13:19.896 --> 13:21.965
- MR. KRABS, I WOULDN'T
TOUCH THAT IF I WERE YOU.
- 先生。蟹蟹，我不会
如果我是你，请触摸它。

13:22.068 --> 13:24.586
THAT GOLD PROBABLY HAS
GHOST GERMS ALL OVER IT.
黄金可能有
浑身都是幽灵细菌。

13:24.689 --> 13:26.758
- OH, DON'T BE SILLY,
SPONGEBOB.
- 哦，别傻了，
海绵宝宝。

13:26.862 --> 13:29.379
THERE'S NO SUCH THING
AS GERMS.
没有这样的事情
作为细菌。

13:33.586 --> 13:35.620
HEADS UP, SQUIDWARD.
HUP!
注意，章鱼哥。
哈普！

13:36.758 --> 13:37.931
HEY, PATRICK.
THINK FAST!
嘿，帕特里克。
快思考！

13:38.034 --> 13:39.620
- THINK?
OOF!
- 思考？
钱币！

13:39.724 --> 13:41.482
- ALL RIGHT THEN!
- 那么好吧！

13:41.586 --> 13:42.965
LET'S GET
WHILE THE GETTIN'S GOOD.
让我们开始吧
虽然进展顺利。

13:43.068 --> 13:44.793
OOH!
哦！

13:44.896 --> 13:47.103
LOOKS LIKE I MISSED ONE.
看来我错过了一个。

13:47.206 --> 13:48.172
[mutters]
[嘀咕]

13:48.275 --> 13:49.862
SEEMS TO BE STUCK
OR SOMETHING.
似乎被卡住了
或者什么。

13:49.965 --> 13:51.758
ARRRGGH!
啊啊啊！

13:51.862 --> 13:53.206
AAH!
啊啊！

13:53.310 --> 13:56.931
- WHO DARES
TOUCH ME GOLD?
- 谁敢
摸我金子？

13:57.034 --> 14:00.103
- OH, IT'S JUST US,
MR. GHOST CAPTAIN, SIR.
- 哦，只有我们，
先生。幽灵船长，先生。

14:00.206 --> 14:02.551
WE BROUGHT THE REPLACEMENT
GASKET YOU ASKED FOR.
我们带来了替换品
您需要的垫片。

14:02.655 --> 14:04.965
SO...IF IT'S NOT
TOO MUCH TROUBLE,
所以...如果不是
太多的麻烦，

14:05.068 --> 14:07.931
DO YOU THINK WE COULD
HAVE OUR SOULS BACK NOW
你认为我们可以吗
现在就让我们的灵魂回来吧

14:08.034 --> 14:10.034
MAYBE?
- A DEAL'S A DEAL,
或许？
- 协议就是协议，

14:10.137 --> 14:11.896
AND I'M A MAN OF ME WORD.
我是一个言出必行的人。

14:12.000 --> 14:14.275
HERE YOU GO, SQUARE ONE.
给你，一号广场。

14:17.137 --> 14:19.034
- AH. THAT HITS THE SPOT.
- 啊。正是如此。

14:19.137 --> 14:21.000
- THINK FAST, PINK ONE.
- 快速思考，粉红一号。

14:21.103 --> 14:22.000
- AGAIN?
- 再次？

14:22.103 --> 14:23.000
OOF!
钱币！

14:23.103 --> 14:24.827
MY SOUL!
我的灵魂！

14:28.000 --> 14:30.137
- HAR HAR HAR!
- 哈哈哈！

14:30.241 --> 14:32.551
THOSE WEREN'T YOUR SOULS.
那些不是你的灵魂。

14:32.655 --> 14:34.655
THOSE WERE JUST A COUPLE
OF OLD ORANGE SODAS
这些只是一对
老橙苏打水

14:34.758 --> 14:38.310
THAT HAD BEEN SITTIN' OUT
IN THE SUN TOO LONG.
那一直在外面
在阳光下晒得太久了。

14:38.413 --> 14:41.862
- I THOUGHT MINE SEEMED
A LITTLE FLAT.
- 我以为我的看起来像
有点平坦。

14:41.965 --> 14:43.586
- BUT WHAT ABOUT
OUR REAL SOULS?
- 但是呢
我们真正的灵魂？

14:43.689 --> 14:45.655
- EH. I NEVER HAD 'EM.
-呃。我从来没有吃过。

14:45.758 --> 14:49.172
EVERYONE KNOWS YOU CAN'T
HOLD ON TO A WILD SOUL.
每个人都知道你不能
保持狂野的灵魂。

14:49.275 --> 14:51.068
WELL, NOW THAT THAT'S SETTLED,
好吧，既然事情已经解决了，

14:51.172 --> 14:53.586
THERE'S STILL
THE LITTLE MATTER OF--
还有
小事——

14:54.689 --> 14:56.931
ME GOLD!
我是金子！

14:57.931 --> 14:59.103
STOP RIGHT THERE!
就停在那里！

14:59.206 --> 15:02.241
NO ONE TOUCHES ME BOOTY
AND GETS AWAY WITH IT.
没有人碰我的战利品
并侥幸逃脱。

15:02.344 --> 15:05.620
- PFFT!
YOU GHOSTS DON'T SCARE ME.
- 噗！
你们这些鬼别吓唬我。

15:05.724 --> 15:07.206
YOU'RE NOTHIN'
BUT THIN AIR.
你什么都不是
但空气稀薄。

15:07.310 --> 15:11.000
GRAB YOUR SACKS
AND FOLLOW ME, BOYS!
带上你的麻袋
跟我来，孩子们！

15:11.103 --> 15:13.103
AAH!
啊啊！

15:13.206 --> 15:15.137
- HAR HAR HAR!
- 哈哈哈！

15:15.241 --> 15:18.517
WELCOME...TO THE VOID!
欢迎...来到虚空！

15:18.620 --> 15:19.896
WHOO HOO HOO HOO HAH HAH!
呼呼呼呼哈哈哈！

15:20.000 --> 15:21.793
- [gibbering]
- [胡言乱语]

15:21.896 --> 15:24.034
- YAA! GET ME OUTTA HERE!
- 是啊！带我离开这里！

15:24.137 --> 15:26.551
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

15:26.655 --> 15:27.551
- HAR HAR HAR HAR!
- 哈哈哈哈！

15:27.655 --> 15:29.344
- OOH!
- 哦！

15:29.448 --> 15:32.482
OH!
哦！

15:34.413 --> 15:37.689
- HMM.
SO THIS IS LIMBO.
- 唔。
所以这就是地狱边境。

15:37.793 --> 15:40.206
WELL, AT LEAST I HAVE
A SACK FULL OF DOUBLOONS
好吧，至少我有
一袋达布隆

15:40.310 --> 15:43.103
TO SPEND ETERNITY WITH.
共度永恒。

15:43.206 --> 15:44.758
UH-OH.
呃-哦。

15:44.862 --> 15:46.517
GOTTA USE THE CAN.
必须使用罐头。

15:46.620 --> 15:48.379
OOH! THERE'S A BIT O' LUCK.
哦！有一点运气。

15:48.482 --> 15:50.655
A PORTABLE POTTY.
便携式便盆。

15:50.758 --> 15:52.413
WHAT'S THIS HERE?
这是什么？

15:52.517 --> 15:54.379
"INSERT DOUBLOON"?
“插入达布隆”？

15:55.689 --> 15:59.689
- NOOOOOOOOOOO!
- 不哦哦哦哦！

16:01.793 --> 16:05.827
- WOW. THIS VOID
SURE IS RELAXING.
- 哇。这个虚空
当然是放松。

16:05.931 --> 16:09.413
HEY! I'VE GOT
A DOUGHNUT ON MY HEAD.
嘿！我有
我头上有一个甜甜圈。

16:09.517 --> 16:11.482
COME HERE, YOU.
来这里，你。

16:11.586 --> 16:14.068
HEY!
嘿！

16:14.172 --> 16:15.689
COME BACK HERE!
回到这里！

16:15.793 --> 16:18.724
AAH!
WHY IS THIS HAPPENING TO ME?
啊啊！
为什么这会发生在我身上？

16:18.827 --> 16:20.379
- HOO HOO HAH HAH HAH!
- 呼呼哈哈哈哈！

16:20.482 --> 16:24.275
WELCOME
TO YOUR WORST NIGHTMARE.
欢迎
致你最可怕的噩梦。

16:24.379 --> 16:26.103
- OH!
NO!
- 哦！
不！

16:26.206 --> 16:28.758
- HOO HOO HAH HAH HAH HAH!
- 呼呼哈哈哈哈哈哈！

16:28.862 --> 16:30.275
HMM?
唔？

16:30.379 --> 16:33.586
HEY, STUPID.
DON'T YA WANNA EAT ME?
嘿，愚蠢的。
你不想吃我吗？

16:33.689 --> 16:37.758
- WELL, NOT REALLY.
I DON'T LIKE PLAIN DOUGHNUTS.
- 嗯，不是真的。
我不喜欢原味甜甜圈。

16:37.862 --> 16:40.482
- WELL...
WHAT KIND DO YOU LIKE?
- 嗯...
您喜欢什么类型的？

16:40.586 --> 16:42.827
- UH...I LIKE SPRINKLES!
- 呃...我喜欢洒水！

16:42.931 --> 16:45.241
- AH. VOILA!
- 啊。瞧！

16:45.344 --> 16:46.482
- NO. CHOCOLATE.
- 不。巧克力。

16:46.586 --> 16:48.862
NO--A BAGEL!
不——百吉饼！

16:48.965 --> 16:51.034
NO, NO, NO!
PANCAKES!
不，不，不！
煎饼！

16:51.137 --> 16:52.172
NO--
- HEY! PICK ONE
不——
- 嘿！选择一个

16:52.275 --> 16:54.931
SO WE CAN GET ON
WITH YOUR ETERNAL TORMENT!
这样我们就可以继续前进
伴随着你永恒的折磨！

16:55.034 --> 16:56.655
- OKAY, OKAY.
- 好吧，好吧。

16:56.758 --> 16:58.137
MAN, YOU'RE PUSHY.
伙计，你很爱出风头。

16:58.241 --> 17:00.000
HOW ABOUT...
怎么样...

17:00.103 --> 17:01.758
A KRABBY PATTY?
蟹肉饼？

17:01.862 --> 17:02.793
WITH PICKLES!
配泡菜！

17:02.896 --> 17:03.965
AND CATSUP!
还有番茄酱！

17:04.068 --> 17:05.689
WAIT, WAIT, WAIT!
I KNOW, I KNOW, I KNOW!
等等，等等，等等！
我知道，我知道，我知道！

17:05.793 --> 17:07.241
I WANT...
我想...

17:07.344 --> 17:09.034
A PLAIN DOUGHNUT!
一个普通的甜甜圈！

17:09.137 --> 17:12.758
- NOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!
- 不哦哦哦哦哦！

17:14.724 --> 17:16.103
- OH, GREAT.
- 哦，太棒了。

17:16.206 --> 17:20.310
I WONDER WHAT MY VISION
OF ETERNAL SUFFERING WILL BE.
I WONDER WHAT MY VISION
永恒的苦难将是。

17:20.413 --> 17:23.517
OF COURSE.
- [slo-mo voice] HI, NEIGHBOR.
当然。
- [slo-mo voice] HI, NEIGHBOR.

17:23.620 --> 17:26.620
HA-HA-HA-HA-HA-HA-HA-HA-HA-HA!
哈哈哈哈哈哈！

17:26.724 --> 17:29.206
- I GUESS THIS IS THE PART
WHERE I START SCREAMING.
- 我想这就是部分
我开始尖叫的地方。

17:29.310 --> 17:31.931
YAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!
啊啊啊啊啊啊！

17:32.034 --> 17:35.137
- HAH HAH HAH HAH
HAH HAH HAH!
- 哈哈哈哈哈哈
哈哈哈哈！

17:38.862 --> 17:41.551
- [chortling]
- HEY, CORPSE BREATH.
- [咯咯笑]
- 嘿，尸体呼吸。

17:41.655 --> 17:42.931
YOU BETTER LET MY FRIENDS
OUTTA THERE
你最好让我的朋友们
离开那里

17:43.034 --> 17:44.413
IF YOU KNOW WHAT'S
GOOD FOR YOU!
如果你知道是什么
对你有好处！

17:44.517 --> 17:46.068
- HA HA HA HA HA!
- 哈哈哈哈哈哈！

17:46.172 --> 17:48.758
AND IF I DON'T...
WHAT'LL YE DO ABOUT IT,
如果我不...
你会怎么做呢？

17:48.862 --> 17:50.827
ME BUBBLE-HEADED LASSIE?
我是泡泡头莱西？

17:50.931 --> 17:53.103
- OH, YOU'LL BE LAUGHING OUT
THE OTHER SIDE OF YOUR TOMBSTONE
- 哦，你会笑的
你墓碑的另一面

17:53.206 --> 17:55.448
ONCE YOU'VE HAD A TASTE
OF MY GHOST CATCHER!
一旦你尝过
我的幽灵捕手！

17:55.551 --> 17:59.413
- OOH! THE BIG CHIPMUNK'S
GONNA GET US!
- 哦！大花栗鼠的
会抓住我们的！

17:59.517 --> 18:01.517
[laughing]
[笑]

18:20.172 --> 18:21.413
- THANKS, LASSIE.
- 谢谢，莱西。

18:21.517 --> 18:23.862
NOW, LET'S JUST GET
THIS HERE BAG OF DOUBLOONS
现在，让我们开始吧
这里有一袋达布隆

18:23.965 --> 18:26.448
BACK TO THE KRUSTY KRAB.
- NOT SO FAST!
回到脆皮蟹。
- 没那么快！

18:26.551 --> 18:29.620
THAT THERE BOOTY BE MINE.
那是我的战利品。

18:29.724 --> 18:32.103
- HEY, YOU THIEVIN'
BILGE RAT!
- 嘿，你这个小偷
舱底老鼠！

18:32.206 --> 18:35.206
I STOLE THIS GOLD
FAIR AND SQUARE!
我偷了这金子
公平公正！

18:35.310 --> 18:37.275
- UH!
- OH!
- 呃！
- 哦！

18:37.379 --> 18:39.206
- OOH!
- OH...
- 哦！
- 哦...

18:39.310 --> 18:41.517
- OOH!
- UH...
- 哦！
- 呃...

18:46.551 --> 18:48.103
- I GOT IT.
OW.
- 我得到了它。
哦。

18:48.206 --> 18:49.586
- ME GOLD!
- 我是金子！

18:49.689 --> 18:51.689
- YOU MEAN MYGOLD.
- 你是说我的黄金。

18:51.793 --> 18:54.655
- HEY, THAT'S FUNNY.
- 嘿，这很有趣。

18:54.758 --> 18:58.172
HMM. THIS CHEST SAYS IT BELONGS
TO THE FLYING DUTCHMAN.
唔。这个箱子说它属于它
飞翔的荷兰人。

18:58.275 --> 18:59.448
- THE FLYING DUTCHMAN?
- 飞翔的荷兰人？

18:59.551 --> 19:01.310
YOU AIN'T AFRAID
HE'S GONNA WANT IT BACK?
你不害怕
他想要回来吗？

19:01.413 --> 19:02.724
- NAH, NAH.
- 不，不。

19:02.827 --> 19:04.724
WE USED TO BE PART
OF THE DUTCHMAN'S CREW.
我们曾经是其中的一部分
荷兰人的船员。

19:04.827 --> 19:07.344
WE STOLE HIS GOLD
HUNDREDS OF YEARS AGO.
我们偷了他的金子
数百年前。

19:07.448 --> 19:09.068
BUT THE DUTCHMAN
HASN'T FOUND US YET.
但是荷兰人
还没找到我们。

19:09.172 --> 19:10.655
AND HE NEVER WILL.
他永远不会。

19:10.758 --> 19:12.517
- AVAST!
- 阿瓦斯特！

19:12.620 --> 19:14.344
- HUH?
- HUH?
- 嗯？
- 嗯？

19:14.448 --> 19:15.862
- HEAVE TO...
AND PREPARE TO BE BOARDED
- 举起...
并准备登机

19:15.965 --> 19:18.000
BY THE FLYING DUTCHMAN!
飞翔的荷兰人！

19:18.103 --> 19:21.241
- THE DUTCHMAN!
HOW DID HE TRACK US DOWN?
- 荷兰人！
他是怎么找到我们的？

19:21.344 --> 19:26.034
UNLESS...THAR BE
A SNITCH ABOARD.
除非...是
船上有告密者。

19:26.137 --> 19:27.413
[dial tone]
[拨号音]

19:27.517 --> 19:29.517
- IT IS MY CIVIC DUTY
TO REPORT STOLEN PROPERTY.
- 这是我的公民义务
报告财产被盗。

19:29.620 --> 19:32.965
- WHY, YOU SCURVY
LITTLE SCUM SCRUBBER.
- 为什么，你坏血病
小浮渣洗涤器。

19:33.068 --> 19:34.448
YOU'VE RUINED EVERYTHING!
你毁了一切！

19:34.551 --> 19:35.793
- WELCOME TO MY WORLD.
- 欢迎来到我的世界。

19:37.620 --> 19:41.068
- AVAST THERE, YOU SCURVY
THIEVIN' BARNACLE BATS!
- 在那里，你坏血病
藤壶蝙蝠小偷！

19:41.172 --> 19:46.413
- DUTCHMAN! BOY, AM I GLAD
WE FINALLY FOUND YOU!
- 荷兰人！男孩，我很高兴
我们终于找到你了！

19:46.517 --> 19:50.103
- SO! IT BE ME OLD FIRST MATE
WHO STOLE ME GOLD
- 所以！是我，老大副
谁偷了我的金子

19:50.206 --> 19:52.000
AND ME CREW!
还有我的船员！

19:52.103 --> 19:54.758
- STOLE YOUR GOLD?
WE JUST WENT OUT TO GET PIZZA.
- 偷了你的金子？
我们刚刚出去买披萨。

19:54.862 --> 19:57.551
- THAT WAS 300 YEARS AGO.
- 那是 300 年前的事了。

19:57.655 --> 19:59.517
- UH...WE GOT LOST?
- 呃...我们迷路了？

19:59.620 --> 20:02.793
OH, BUT WE BEEN LOOKIN'
FOR YA EVER SINCE...
哦，但我们一直在寻找
自从你...

20:02.896 --> 20:05.275
TO GIVE YA BACK
YOUR TREASURE.
回馈你
您的宝藏。

20:05.379 --> 20:07.586
- [gasps]
ME BOOTY!
- [喘气]
我的战利品！

20:07.689 --> 20:11.724
WELL, MAYBE I MISJUDGED
YOU FELLAS.
好吧，也许我判断错误
你们伙计们。

20:11.827 --> 20:14.137
I'M SORRY
I WAS SO CROSS WITH YA.
对不起
我对你很生气。

20:14.241 --> 20:16.344
AAH!
啊啊！

20:16.448 --> 20:17.379
OOF!
钱币！

20:17.482 --> 20:19.827
WHY, YOU TREACHEROUS
SEA DEVILS!
为什么，你这个奸诈的人
海魔！

20:19.931 --> 20:22.310
WHEN I'M DONE WITH YOU,
YOU--
当我和你在一起时，
你——

20:25.793 --> 20:28.827
OKAY.
NOW I'M A LITTLE BIT PEEVED.
好的。
现在我有点生气。

20:30.103 --> 20:32.310
- HEE HEE HAH HAH HAH!
- 嘻嘻哈哈哈！

20:32.413 --> 20:36.172
WELL, THE DUTCHMAN
WAS ALWAYS A SAP.
嗯，荷兰人
一直都是个笨蛋。

20:36.275 --> 20:37.413
- FROG WHISKERS!
- 青蛙胡须！

20:37.517 --> 20:39.068
THE DUTCHMAN'S ON OUR TAIL!
荷兰人在跟踪我们！

20:40.413 --> 20:42.793
- HA HA HA!
NOW THAT THE ENGINE'S FIXED,
- 哈哈哈！
现在发动机修好了，

20:42.896 --> 20:45.586
THE DUTCHMAN
WILL NEVER CATCH UP WITH US.
荷兰人
永远追不上我们。

20:45.689 --> 20:47.206
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

20:49.689 --> 20:51.310
[engine sputtering]
[发动机溅射声]

20:51.413 --> 20:53.551
- BOILER ROOM,
WE'RE LOSING POWER.
- 锅炉房，
我们正在失去电力。

20:53.655 --> 20:54.586
REPORT!
报告！

20:54.689 --> 20:57.586
- THE ENGINE'S ON FIRE, SIR.
- 发动机着火了，长官。

20:59.137 --> 21:00.931
- THE DUTCHMAN'S
GAINING ON US!
- 荷兰人的
战胜我们！

21:03.379 --> 21:04.275
- WE'RE GOING DOWN!
- 我们要下去了！

21:04.379 --> 21:06.551
BRACE FOR IMPACT!
做好应对冲击的准备！

21:06.655 --> 21:08.896
- AAH!
- AAH!
- 啊啊！
- 啊啊！

21:09.000 --> 21:12.758
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

21:15.000 --> 21:17.034
- DON'T GO ANYWHERE, KIDDIES,
- 别去任何地方，孩子们，

21:17.137 --> 21:18.896
'CAUSE YOU'RE ABOUT
TO BE CURSED...
因为你即将
被诅咒...

21:19.000 --> 21:22.034
LIKE YOU'VE NEVER
BEEN CURSED BEFORE!
就像你从未有过的那样
以前被诅咒过！

21:22.137 --> 21:23.793
- UH-OH. I DON'T LIKE
THE SOUND OF THAT.
- 呃-哦。我不喜欢
那声音。

21:23.896 --> 21:25.724
- OBSERVE!
- 观察！

21:33.896 --> 21:36.068
YEEEEAAAAAHHHH...
耶耶啊啊啊啊……

21:36.172 --> 21:37.344
HA HA HA HA!
哈哈哈哈！

21:41.586 --> 21:46.758
YEEEAAAH HA HA HA HA!
耶啊哈哈哈哈！

21:49.310 --> 21:52.206
[folksy music]
[民谣音乐]

21:52.310 --> 21:53.689
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

21:53.793 --> 21:55.448
- AH, WELCOME TO
THE KURSED KRAB.
- 啊，欢迎来到
被诅咒的螃蟹。

21:55.551 --> 21:57.551
HOW CAN WE SERVE YOU
THIS ETERNITY?
我们如何为您服务
这个永恒？

21:57.655 --> 22:00.241
- I JUST NEED TO USE
THE BATHROOM.
- 我只需要使用
浴室。

22:00.344 --> 22:02.103
- IT'S RIGHT OVER THERE.
- 就在那里。

22:02.206 --> 22:03.448
[bones rattling]
[骨头嘎嘎作响]

22:03.551 --> 22:06.620
- WELL, HERE'S YOUR
MILKSHAKE, SANDY.
- 好吧，这是你的
奶昔，桑迪。

22:08.379 --> 22:10.000
- GOTCHA,
YOU LITTLE GREMLIN!
- 明白了，
你这个小鬼！

22:11.379 --> 22:13.827
- AND WHAT WOULD YOULIKE,
SIR?
- 你想要什么，
先生？

22:13.931 --> 22:16.655
- I WANT A PLAIN DOUGHNUT.
- 我想要一个原味甜甜圈。

22:16.758 --> 22:20.241
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

22:21.620 --> 22:23.103
- HOW'S THE HAUL,
MR. SQUIDWARD?
- 运输怎么样，
先生。章鱼哥？

22:23.206 --> 22:24.586
- EVERYONE'S PAYING
WITH BONES.
- 每个人都在付钱
有骨头。

22:24.689 --> 22:26.413
- WELL, MONEY'S MONEY.
- 好吧，钱就是钱。

22:26.517 --> 22:28.482
- NO. I MEAN...
ACTUAL BONES.
- 不。我的意思是...
真实的骨头。

22:28.586 --> 22:30.275
[ca-ching]
[嘉庆]

22:30.379 --> 22:32.965
- HMM. THOSE MUST BE WORTH
SOMETHING DOWN HERE.
- 唔。这些一定是值得的
下面有东西。

22:33.068 --> 22:34.517
[bell dings]
- ORDER UP, SQUIDWARD.
[铃声]
- 下令，章鱼哥。

22:34.620 --> 22:36.241
EVERYBODY
HOLD ON TO SOMETHING!
大家
坚持做某事！

22:36.344 --> 22:38.896
IT'S TIME TO
FLIP THE PATTIES!
是时候了
翻转肉饼！

22:39.000 --> 22:40.413
HIT IT!
击中它！

22:40.517 --> 22:43.275
- [laughing]
- [笑]

22:43.379 --> 22:44.275
[patrons screaming]
[顾客尖叫]

22:44.379 --> 22:46.206
- [laughing]
- [笑]

22:46.310 --> 22:51.655
YAH HAH HAH HAH HAH
HAH HAH HAH HAH HAH!
呀哈哈哈哈哈哈
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！

呀哈哈哈哈哈哈
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！